('PFPDOMAIN-F036','Lyapunov tracker checks less than advertised descent','Tracker documents V=Phi+Gamma nonincrease on E/M/Lambda, but record_step checks only Phi on E/M and is_strictly_monotonic trusts stored delta. An exact synthetic trace C,E,Lambda with V1,10,19 reportsTrue. This trace defect is separate from cascade.solve, which currently refuses immediately at the unavailable functional boundary.',[ev('pfp/domain/ddc/dda.py',(82,153),(184,198)),ev('pfp/domain/ddc/triad.py',(107,113))],['PFPDOMAIN-C045']),
('PFPDOMAIN-F037','Exact micro-USD conversion rounds through binary float','MicroUsdSpend.from_usd converts Decimal tofloat before multiplying/rounding. Decimal9007199254.740993 should yield9007199254740993microUSD but returns9007199254740994; tiny negative amount rounds tozero. BoundedTemperature separately admitsNaN. These violate the constructors described exact/nonnegative or bounded input contract; no real spend occurred.',[ev('pfp/domain/value_objects/numerics.py',(49,70),(88,99))],['PFPDOMAIN-C046']),
